ZVSE2
; WoG Debug - the vertical slice of the port: an ERA script that changes the game every day.
; At the start of every day each human player gets +1000 gold.
; Switch it off by removing "WoG Debug" from [ERA] ModList in BepInEx/config/wog.oldenera.cfg.

!?FU(OnEveryDay);
!!OW:C?(owner:y);
!!OW:I(owner)/?(isAi:y);
!!FU&(isAi)=1:E;
!!OW:R(owner)/6/d1000;
